            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Elizabeth II's Early Life</strong><br>\nElizabeth II was born on April 21, 1926, in London as the first child of the Duke and Duchess of York. She was not born a direct heir to the throne but became next in line when her uncle, King Edward VIII, abdicated, and her father became King George VI. Elizabeth received a private education at home, studying history, language, literature, and music. During World War II, she made her first public appearance inspecting troops, showing her early dedication to royal duties.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The War Years</strong><br>\nDuring World War II, Elizabeth played a symbolic role in supporting the morale of the British people. At age 14, she gave her first radio broadcast addressing other children who had been evacuated from cities. She trained as a driver and mechanic in the Auxiliary Territorial Service. These efforts helped to endear her to the public and solidified her image as a committed and capable member of the royal family.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Ascension to the Throne</strong><br>\nElizabeth became queen at the age of 25 after the death of her father, King George VI, on February 6, 1952. Her coronation on June 2, 1953, was the first to be televised, attracting millions of viewers worldwide. As queen, Elizabeth II embarked on numerous state visits overseas and dedicated herself to numerous charitable causes, reflecting the changing role of the monarchy in a modern world.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
